# QM/MM Reaction Energies

This directory contains the spreadsheet `energy correct.xlsx`, which reports the QM/MM reaction-path energy data used in the manuscript.

The reported reaction profiles include zero-point energy corrections. Relative energies are referenced to the reactant complex of the corresponding system and are expressed in kcal/mol.

## Structure Labels

- RC: reactant complex.
- TS or TS1/TS2: transition state or sequential transition states.
- IM1: intermediate.
- P: product complex.
